  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專題討論",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標主要著重在訓練學生針對特定研究主題進行文獻資料搜集與分類、資料內容閱讀、分析整理以及製作成專業的報告，而修課同學需針對所選定之主題內容進行口頭報告，並由全班同學共同參與討論發問，藉以訓練上台報告與溝通的技巧，並相互觀摩學習。此外，除課堂講授外，課程內容亦涵蓋業界與學界專家之專題演講，於分享專家之經驗與成果外，同時教育學生工程倫理的觀念",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides students with an understanding on the process of searching, analyzing, interpreting, and summarizing literature to write a technical report in terms of specific research topics. To enhance students’ presentation and communication skills, each student is expected to give an oral presentation followed by group discussions on selected topic in front of the class. Students can learn from each other through group interaction in this class. In addition, students are also required to attend scheduled speeches given by speakers invited from industries and academic community. This provides students opportunities to learn from speakers’ experiential sharing and awareness of engineering ethics.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "藉由參與演講，了解相關專業倫理、未來應具備之社會責任以及激發創新思考",
      "describe_en": "To understand the importance of engineering ethics and professional responsibilities to society, and inspire the innovation and creativity through the invited speeches"
    }
  ],
